   "unit": "Ω",
   "condition": "Calibrator set to 10 Ω, operate, EXT SNS. A10 on the extender card, powered. Four-terminal ohmmeter (Fluke 8505A or equivalent): IN HI to TP4, IN LO to TP3, SENSE HI to TP5, SENSE LO to TP2.",
