   "note": "The one value §5-12 spells out in full; steps 3 and Table 5-2 repeat the same connection for the rest. The 10 Ω element itself is the bottom resistor of the 1x string inside Z1. Everything between the test points and it is relay contacts, which is why step 2's failure branch sends you to the relay chart (schematic sheets 3 and 4) rather than to a component.",
